      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A truly stunning 4 bedroom detached block built residence situated on a rectangular shaped site with full privacy, this property has been completed to impressively high standards throughout and has a floor area that extends to c. 227 sq.m (c.2,450 sq.ft). Providing generously proportioned areas throughout, this family home has some spectacular features from its wood and tiled flooring finishes, open plan kitchen/dining, fully landscaped gardens with dining areas, large block built garage & a fully secured perimeter. This is a quality home in a prime family location within easy access of Drogheda Town Centre and the M1 Motorway, both within a 10 minute drive. No expense has been spared and this property has been tastefully built with marvellous attention to detail. Viewing Is Highly Recommended. \n\nAMV 745,000 For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures\n4 Bedroom Detached Residence\nExtends to C. 227 sq.m. (c. 2,450 sq.ft.)\n''A'' BER Energy Rating\nBuilt C. 2002\nC. 0.6 Acre Site\nWhole House Water Softener System\nSolid Concrete 1st Floor \nSmart Homes Technology with Cat-5 Cabling\nMusic/Entertainment Available to Each Room\nGeoThermal Underfloor Heating\nFull Zone Heating Controls\nComposite Front & Rear External Doors\nDouble & Triple Glazing Throughout\nWood Burning Stove\n9-10 ft Ceilings on Ground Floor\nWaste BIO Cycle Unit\nWater Ballymakenny Group Water Scheme \nFully Alarmed \nPull Down Staircase to Partially Floored Attic\nGarage (8.13m x 4.90m)\nElectric Roller Security Gate\nSurrounding Tobermoe Cobble Lock Footpaths\nExternal Garden Security Lighting\nRaised Planter Beds\nSunny South Facing Rear Orientation\nTobermore Cobble Lock Patio Seating Areas\nFully Private Surrounding Aspects\nMatured Landscaped Gardens\n\nAccommodation Includes\nEntrance Hallway\nReception Room / Bed 5 (4.26m x 4.64m)\nLiving Room(4.13m x 4.65m)\nKitchen(4.22m x 4.15m)\nDining Area(4.15m x 3.55m)\nUtility Room(2.45m x 2.97m)\nGuest Bathroom(1.65m x 2.97m)\nSun Room(4.24m x 4.97m)\n\n1st Floor\nLanding \nBedroom 1(3.97m x 4.14m)\nEn Suite(2.28m x 1.85m)\nBedroom 2(4.16m x 3.91m)\nBedroom 3(4.11m x 3.63m)\nBedroom 4(2.72m x 4.16m)\nMain Bathroom(2.65m x 2.65m)\nLanding Study Area\n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: A\nBER number : 102782646\n\nViewing Details\nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent. \n"
